cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Models of arithmetic of two minds about consistency: Lean 4 formalization"
abstract: >-
  A complete Lean 4 formalization, over the Foundation library, of the results
  of the paper "Models of arithmetic of two minds about consistency": machine
  consistency statements, the normal form theorem, and the main theorem that
  every pattern of consistency verdicts consistent with the provable
  implications is realized.
type: software
